      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue isn't really new; it can also be reproduced by switching to a 2000m tall avatar and back to a 1.75m avatar, without the Skip Leg Day toggle. For example, `avtr_b3a2cfec-eb56-4763-9367-b87ae95d12f0` (emm by ＧＯＢＬＩＮ).\n\nReloading the avatar fixes the avatar rig/IK again.\n\n(Aside: Fun things also happen by turning a Humanoid avatar from a normal pose to completely flat, switching to a Generic rigged avatar, and back to the same Humanoid avatar in normal pose. Avatar \"broky test\" by @{68868106076be5baa65e2f97|full_name}, based on a Rusk avatar by komado.)\n\nDesktop mode attachments (before & after) for reference.",
